---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../components/FinalCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About DataDecision and founder Ashish Jha"
  description="DataDecision is a founder-led, measurement-first consultancy. Meet founder Ashish Jha and read the principles behind its AI-search visibility work."
  path="/about/"
  schema={[
    {
      '@context': 'https://schema.org',
      '@type': 'AboutPage',
      name: 'About DataDecision',
      url: 'https://datadecision.consulting/about/',
      mainEntity: {
        '@type': 'Organization',
        name: 'DataDecision',
        email: 'contact@datadecision.consulting',
        founder: { '@type': 'Person', name: 'Ashish Jha' },
      },
    },
    {
      '@context': 'https://schema.org',
      '@type': 'Person',
      name: 'Ashish Jha',
      jobTitle: 'Founder',
      url: 'https://datadecision.consulting/about/',
      email: 'contact@datadecision.consulting',
      alumniOf: { '@type': 'CollegeOrUniversity', name: 'NIT Surat' },
      worksFor: {
        '@type': 'Organization',
        name: 'DataDecision',
        url: 'https://datadecision.consulting/',
      },
    },
  ]}
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'About' }]} />
  <header class="shell page-hero page-hero--compact">
    <div class="page-hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About DataDecision</p><h1>A measurement practice built for scrutiny.</h1><p
        class="lede"
      >
        A focused consultancy for B2B SaaS teams that need a defensible view of AI-search visibility
        and the measurement path into pipeline.
      </p>
    </div><aside class="page-hero__aside">
      <div class="folio"><span>Company description</span><span>01 line</span></div><p
        class="lede"
        style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.8rem;"
      >
        Focused on AI-search visibility, measurement foundations and scoped implementation.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </header>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="founder-heading">
    <div class="shell founder-record">
      <div class="founder-record__identity">
        <p class="eyebrow">Founder</p>
        <h2 id="founder-heading">Ashish Jha</h2>
        <p class="small">Founder, DataDecision<br />Graduate, NIT Surat</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@datadecision.consulting">
          contact@datadecision.consulting
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="founder-record__body">
        <p class="lede">
          Ashish Jha founded DataDecision to build a measurement-first practice for AI-search
          visibility and the path into pipeline.
        </p>
        <p class="measure">
          His public operating standard is straightforward: define the observation frame before
          interpreting the output, publish limitations beside conclusions, and recommend only work
          the evidence can support. DataDecision’s focused launch scope reflects that standard.
        </p>
        <dl class="founder-record__facts">
          <div>
            <dt>Education</dt>
            <dd>NIT Surat</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Credential boundary</dt>
            <dd class="small">Identification only; no institutional endorsement is claimed.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell editorial-grid editorial-grid--reverse">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why this exists</p><h2>Evidence should survive the handoff.</h2>
      </div><div>
        <p class="lede">
          DataDecision begins with a simple operating belief: the method, assumptions and limits
          should travel with every marketing number. That matters more as discovery moves across
          search pages, generated answers, review sources and private conversations that no single
          dashboard can fully observe.
        </p><p class="measure">
          The firm is being built from the measurement layer outward. Its launch offer is
          intentionally narrower than a full-service growth agency, because capability should be
          demonstrated before it is advertised.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--bright">
    <div class="shell editorial-grid">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Operating principles</p><h2>How the work is judged.</h2>
      </div><div class="rule-list">
        <div class="rule-row">
          <span class="mono">01</span><div>
            <h3>Evidence over adjectives</h3><p>
              Describe the method and observation before describing the outcome.
            </p>
          </div><span class="rule-row__meta">Claim discipline</span>
        </div><div class="rule-row">
          <span class="mono">02</span><div>
            <h3>Baselines before bravado</h3><p>
              Define the starting record before proposing a change.
            </p>
          </div><span class="rule-row__meta">Comparability</span>
        </div><div class="rule-row">
          <span class="mono">03</span><div>
            <h3>Method in public</h3><p>
              Publish the rules needed to interrogate a number without disclosing private client
              data.
            </p>
          </div><span class="rule-row__meta">Transparency</span>
        </div><div class="rule-row">
          <span class="mono">04</span><div>
            <h3>Uncertainty stays visible</h3><p>
              Unknown, unavailable and ambiguous are separate states—not inconvenient zeros.
            </p>
          </div><span class="rule-row__meta">Honesty</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--ink">
    <div class="shell editorial-grid editorial-grid--balanced">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#9fd2bc;">Claim boundaries</p><h2>
          Credibility starts with restraint.
        </h2>
      </div><div>
        <p class="lede" style="color:#d3d6d1;">
          The launch site does not claim clients, logos, testimonials, partners, offices, headcount,
          awards, proprietary datasets or guaranteed placements. Its founder record contains the
          facts supplied and approved for publication, without an invented biography, portrait or
          experience claim.
        </p><div class="annotation" style="margin-top:2rem;color:var(--ink);">
          <span class="evidence-label">Current truth</span><p>
            Ashish Jha leads the work. The launch scope is focused, the method is public and
            demonstration research is clearly labelled.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <FinalCTA heading="Start with a question the evidence can answer." />
</BaseLayout>
